resources.string:
JSON OUTPUT SCHEMA:
{
 "gesamtanalyse": "...",
 "top_massnahmen": [...],
 "kategorien": [...]
}

1) "gesamtanalyse" (15–25 sentences): Name all goals, identify progress.

2) "top_massnahmen" (exactly 5): Next steps.
 { "titel": "...", "beschreibung": "13–21 words", "erklaerung": "5–8 sentences" }

3) "kategorien": Goal areas.
 {
 "name": "max 12 characters", "icon": "material_icon", "farbe": "#HEX",
 "entropie_level": 0.0, "zusammenfassung": "3–5 sentences",
 "ratschlaege": [{
 "titel": "...",
 "beschreibung": "13–21 words. Status: [open/in progress/blocked/achieved]. Next step: [...].",
 "prioritaet": "hoch|mittel|niedrig",
 "verknuepfung": "...", "herleitung": [{"datum":"...","zusammenfassung":"..."}]
 }]
 }
 Areas: Fitness, Health, Work, Career, Finances, Relationships, Projects, Learning, Sleep, Mental Health, Travel, Organization, Creativity
 Priority: hoch=blocked, mittel=open, niedrig=in progress/achieved
